<import src="../../templates/wage-days.wxml"/><view class="page-shell" style="font-size:{{fontSize}}px"><block wx:if="{{ready&&personal}}"><view class="small space">{{wages.from}} 至 {{wages.to}}</view><view class="card"><view>工资合计</view><view class="wage-total">{{totalText}}</view><view wx:if="{{wages.unpricedCount}}" class="small">部分项目单价待设置。</view></view><view class="card wage-breakdown"><template is="wage-days" data="{{days:days}}"/></view></block><block wx:if="{{ready&&!personal}}"><view class="card"><view class="title">班组平均工资</view><view class="small space">预制块基础工资＝班组当日总吨数÷实际参与人数×单价，人数从最新有效记录的工人去重计算。</view><view class="field"><view class="field-label">预制块计价方式</view><nice-select class="wage-select" options="{{modes}}" value="{{policy.precastMode}}" bindchange="policyChoice" bindopen="closeChoices" font-size="{{fontSize}}"/></view><view class="field"><view class="field-label">应用日期</view><picker mode="date" value="{{form.effectiveDate}}" data-key="effectiveDate" bindchange="choice"><view class="date-choice">{{form.effectiveDate}}</view></picker></view><view class="field"><view class="field-label">预制块单价（元/吨）</view><input type="digit" value="{{policy.precastRate}}" data-key="precastRate" bindinput="policyInput"/></view><view class="field"><view class="field-label">浇注料单价换算为元/吨的倍数</view><input type="digit" value="{{policy.materialMultiplier}}" data-key="materialMultiplier" bindinput="policyInput"/></view><view class="summary"><text class="small">手工补助已核定（不影响实时计算）</text><switch checked="{{policy.supplementsConfirmed}}" bindchange="confirmed" color="#11766d"/></view><button class="primary" bindtap="savePolicy" disabled="{{busy}}">保存规则</button></view>
<view class="card"><view class="title">项目单价</view><view class="field"><view class="field-label">应用日期</view><picker mode="date" value="{{form.effectiveDate}}" data-key="effectiveDate" bindchange="choice"><view class="date-choice">{{form.effectiveDate}}</view></picker></view><view class="field"><view class="field-label">产品 / 项目</view><nice-select class="wage-select" searchable options="{{products}}" value="{{form.productId}}" data-key="productId" bindchange="choice" bindopen="closeChoices" font-size="{{fontSize}}"/></view><view class="field"><view class="field-label">计价方式</view><nice-select class="wage-select" options="{{bases}}" value="{{form.basis}}" data-key="basis" bindchange="choice" bindopen="closeChoices" font-size="{{fontSize}}"/></view><view class="field"><view class="field-label">单价</view><input type="digit" value="{{form.rate}}" data-key="rate" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="small space">从应用日期（含当天）起重算历史及之后的工资，之前保留原单价。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="saveRate" disabled="{{busy}}">保存项目单价</button></view>
<view class="card"><view class="title">手工补助 / 扣款</view><view class="field"><view class="field-label">工人</view><nice-select class="wage-select" searchable options="{{workers}}" value="{{form.workerId}}" data-key="workerId" bindchange="choice" bindopen="closeChoices" font-size="{{fontSize}}"/></view><view class="field"><view class="field-label">日期</view><input value="{{form.date}}" data-key="date" bindinput="input" placeholder="例如2026-10-10"/></view><view class="field"><view class="field-label">金额（补助正数、扣款负数）</view><input type="text" value="{{form.amount}}" data-key="amount" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="field"><view class="field-label">说明</view><textarea value="{{form.reason}}" data-key="reason" bindinput="input" maxlength="300"/></view><view class="small space">二组指定型号和产量补助自动计算。手工金额另行叠加，请核对是否重复；同一人同一天保存替换原手工金额。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="saveAdjustment" disabled="{{busy}}">保存补助 / 扣款</button></view></block></view>
